[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11280.71, "timestamp": "03:08:00", "text": "因为，你知道，这就像真实的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11282.87, "timestamp": "03:08:02", "text": "事情，我们是如何真正起飞的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11286.23, "timestamp": "03:08:06", "text": "生活。在《王牌》里，事情就是这样发生的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11287.59, "timestamp": "03:08:07", "text": "我认为是战斗。而且它也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11289.51, "timestamp": "03:08:09", "text": "《壮志凌云》系列电影中是如何发生的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11292.389, "timestamp": "03:08:12", "text": "所以如果你击中了Vi，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11294.07, "timestamp": "03:08:14", "text": "这就是你如何起步的。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11296.469, "timestamp": "03:08:16", "text": "你所看到的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11298.469, "timestamp": "03:08:18", "text": "或者你可以再次按下 B 键，然后你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11300.15, "timestamp": "03:08:20", "text": "就像看到你的整个飞机一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11301.83, "timestamp": "03:08:21", "text": "已启动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11308.07, "timestamp": "03:08:28", "text": "不，B不是break。这取决于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11313.03, "timestamp": "03:08:33", "text": "按键绑定。它显示油门是BRK"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11320.389, "timestamp": "03:08:40", "text": "伟大的。是的。总之，等等吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11322.07, "timestamp": "03:08:42", "text": "第二。你想使用哪种摄像机视角？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11324.309, "timestamp": "03:08:44", "text": "和谁一起去？选这个还是选那个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11327.429, "timestamp": "03:08:47", "text": "另一个是指这个吗？是的。另一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11330.15, "timestamp": "03:08:50", "text": "是这个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11333.87, "timestamp": "03:08:53", "text": "我想，我们试试可卡犬吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11337.67, "timestamp": "03:08:57", "text": "好的。立即将油门开到110%。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11338.91, "timestamp": "03:08:58", "text": "快速前往"}]